  "details": "With the most recent update, 2 of my worlds that I had in community labs were in stages of WIPs. One of which had its triggers become broken the day before due to a VRChat update, making it unplayable.\n\nI would like an option to have the choice of letting a community lab map be allowed to stay in community labs for as long as the author wants it to. Only after the world maker feels it's ready, then have the vrchat approval bot or employee approve it for public release",
